# Library Management System

## 🚀 Live Demo
[Coming Soon]

## 📋 Overview
A full-stack Library Management System with role-based access control, JWT authentication, and complete book management features.

## ✨ Features

### Authentication & Authorization
- JWT-based authentication with refresh tokens
- Role-based access (Admin/User)
- Secure password hashing with bcrypt
- Protected routes and API endpoints

### Book Management
- ✅ View all books with search and filter
- ✅ Add new books (Admin only)
- ✅ Edit book details (Admin only)
- ✅ Delete books (Admin only)
- ✅ Borrow books (All authenticated users)
- ✅ Return books (All authenticated users)
- ✅ Real-time availability status

### UI/UX
- Responsive design with TailwindCSS
- Real-time search and filtering
- Toast notifications for actions
- Loading states and error handling
- Role-based UI rendering

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

### Frontend
- React 18 with TypeScript
- TailwindCSS for styling
- React Router DOM for navigation
- Axios for API calls
- Context API for state management

### Backend
- Node.js with Express
- MongoDB with Mongoose ODM
- JWT for authentication
- bcrypt for password hashing
- express-validator for input validation

### DevOps
- Docker & Docker Compose
- Git for version control

## 📦 Installation

### Prerequisites
- Node.js (v18 or higher)
- MongoDB (local or Atlas)
- npm or yarn

### Clone Repository
```bash
git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/library-management-system.git
cd library-management-system